<view class="page">
  <view class="login-top"><view class="brand-mark"></view><view class="eyebrow">陪伴学习 · 记录成长</view><view class="login-brand">晚辅智管</view><view class="subtitle">让每一天的努力，都有迹可循。</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{hasSession}}" class="card"><view class="card-title">已有登录会话</view><view class="actions"><button class="secondary" bindtap="resume">返回工作台</button><button class="text-button" bindtap="logout">退出当前账号</button></view></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="card-head"><view class="card-title">机构账号登录</view><text class="badge">真实账号</text></view><view class="field"><text class="label">账号</text><input value="{{username}}" data-field="username" bindinput="field" placeholder="请输入机构账号" disabled="{{busy}}" /></view><view class="field"><text class="label">密码</text><input value="{{password}}" password data-field="password" bindinput="field" placeholder="请输入密码" disabled="{{busy}}" /></view><button class="primary" bindtap="submit" data-mode="account" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">登录</button><view class="hint">账号角色由后端决定。切换真实角色需登录对应机构账号。</view></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="card-head"><view class="card-title">本地演示入口</view><text class="badge warn">仅 local 环境</text></view><view class="muted">使用虚构学生与演示会话。此入口不会完成真实微信授权登录。</view><picker class="gap" range="{{roles}}" value="{{roleIndex}}" bindchange="role" disabled="{{busy}}">体验身份：{{roles[roleIndex]}}</picker><button class="secondary gap" bindtap="submit" data-mode="demo" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">进入本地演示</button><view class="hint">教师由后端授权班级，家长由后端绑定孩子。生产环境关闭此接口。</view></view>
  <view class="notice">真实微信登录尚未配置：当前后端没有 wx.login code 换取会话接口。需由后端接入 AppID、AppSecret 和微信身份绑定后开放；此处不会模拟成功。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view class="muted mini">{{health}}</view><view class="muted mini body-text">服务地址：{{apiBase}}</view>
</view>
